[{"client_msg_id":"2BB384DC-1E81-4ACD-A630-3523DA021C40","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"```impl Default for FontDescription {\n    fn default() -\u0026gt; FontDescription {\n        FontDescription {\n            #[cfg(not(any(target_os = \"macos\", windows)))]\n            family: \"monospace\".into(),\n            #[cfg(target_os = \"macos\")]\n            family: \"Menlo\".into(),\n            #[cfg(windows)]\n            family: \"Consolas\".into(),\n            style: None,\n        }\n    }\n}```\nとあるので Menlo ?","ts":"1619617473.084200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Xljd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6d51c74e-9911-45b1-9c99-9c72a553884c","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"Helvetica とかがそういうフォーマットだったと思います","ts":"1619617018.083800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DNeFt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"627a484c-cdaf-4ce8-8df2-f9ee3cc5dec3","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"dfont知らない子だ\n今回のはAlacrittyで内蔵されてるフォントを使いたかったのですが、名前がわからなかったので調べていた感じですね","ts":"1619616922.083500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"k/6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b092e956-8774-4b4e-b534-af0ae439264d","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"dfont という謎のフォーマット","ts":"1619615702.082500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RjBtn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"58b4d741-7935-427b-9d85-b42ce4cbbec2","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"macOS のフォントは謎に満ちていますね","ts":"1619615697.082300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gGzwH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8785027d-2802-4849-a586-5f19ca429c52","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"例えばヒラギノフォントでしたらこの辺りに引っかかりそう\n\u0026gt; 1.3 購入したフォントを複数台のコンピュータで使用したいが可能ですか？\n\u0026gt; 1ライセンスにつき1台のコンピュータでご使用ください。複数台のコンピュータでお使いいただく場合は、台数分の製品をご購入ください。","ts":"1619615649.082000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"th1k"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ad2c3e2e-ce7f-4fc8-bd7c-d4847a0b7f8f","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"\u0026gt; E. フォント　本契約の契約条件に従って、お客様は、Appleソフトウェアの起動中にコンテンツを表示 およびプリントするために、Appleソフトウェアに入っているフォントを使用することができます。しか し、お客様は、問題になっているフォントに付属する組み込み制限が許諾する場合のみ、コンテンツの 中にフォントを組み込むことができます。これらの組み込み制限は、Font Book/プレビュー/フォント 情報を表示、においてご覧になれます。","ts":"1619615293.081300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/PsLL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"737cb179-988b-45a4-bd92-0f0ded827639","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"(正直怪しそうですね…)","ts":"1619615069.081000","edited":{"user":"U017BU3UZBQ","ts":"1619615337.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Oo+3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c3beda9f-26ee-4a91-8798-17a2439bb557","type":"message","user":"UEACRCY0Z","text":"あまり取り出そうと思ったことがないですが、取り出して他で使えるんですかね？ライセンス的に","ts":"1619614912.080500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1Yj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6c01eb52-edfd-400c-b130-b3028208b423","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"うわー訳のわからないところにある…\n`/System/Library/AssetsV2/com_apple_MobileAsset_Font6`\n昔からこんなところにありましたっけ？","ts":"1619612009.079600","edited":{"user":"U017BU3UZBQ","ts":"1619612075.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0S/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"57e69abb-a6c0-45e3-9229-01920e4889b8","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"~あ、気のせいでした~:jiketsu:","ts":"1619611564.078500","edited":{"user":"U017BU3UZBQ","ts":"1619612161.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_i